# wave.obligations — disposition for every `allium plan` obligation of wave.allium.
# `host-lifecycle obligations spec/wave.allium --tests tests` checks this is complete.
#   <id> => structural | test:<name> exercises=<symbol> | waived: <reason>
# structural = the spec's own check/analyse lane discharges it (field presence, enum
# comparability, surface shape, the declared transition graph's rejection and terminals).
# waived  = an honest recorded gap. The wave path has no runnable test harness yet: the
# driver is not buildable in CI until the vendored DDK bundle lands (call/0008), and the
# kernel-mode WaveCyclic code needs a userspace-testable extraction. plan/0004 lands that
# harness and converts these to test: dispositions exercising the decision symbols.

# --- Spec-integrity (covered by the check/analyse lane) ---
config-default.rate_high            => structural
config-default.rate_upper_mid       => structural
config-default.rate_lower_mid       => structural
config-default.rate_low             => structural
config-default.fifo_threshold       => structural
enum-comparable.BitDepth            => structural
enum-comparable.ChannelCount        => structural
entity-fields.Format                => structural
entity-fields.Stream                => structural
entity-optional.Stream.format       => structural
surface-actor.WaveRender            => structural
surface-provides.WaveRender         => structural
transition-rejected.Stream.state    => structural
transition-terminal.Stream.state    => structural

# --- Behavioural (no runnable harness yet; discharged by tests under plan/0004) ---
transition-edge.Stream.stopped.paused  => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
transition-edge.Stream.paused.running  => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
transition-edge.Stream.running.paused  => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
transition-edge.Stream.paused.stopped  => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
transition-edge.Stream.running.stopped => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
invariant.Stream.RunningIsConfigured   => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.AcceptPcmFormat           => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-failure.AcceptPcmFormat.1         => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.ResampleOffRate           => test:test_nearest_rate exercises=NearestSupportedRate
rule-failure.ResampleOffRate.1         => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.DitherWideFormat          => test:test_dither exercises=WaveDspDither
rule-failure.DitherWideFormat.1        => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.StartRender               => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-failure.StartRender.1             => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.PauseRender               => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.ReadPosition              => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-failure.ReadPosition.1            => waived: no wave test harness until plan/0004 (needs a build; call/0008)
